WEBVTT

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:04.783
Hi, friends.

00:00:04.783 --> 00:00:08.350
Sit tall in your chair. Feet flat on the floor.

00:00:08.350 --> 00:00:11.323
Hands in your lap. Shoulders soft.

00:00:11.323 --> 00:00:13.701
Take one slow breath with me… and let it go.

00:00:13.701 --> 00:00:16.079
This is Gratitude Three.

00:00:16.079 --> 00:00:21.429
We think of three good things — one at a time — and we hold each one for a moment.

00:00:21.429 --> 00:00:25.591
There are no wrong answers. Your three are yours.

00:00:25.591 --> 00:00:37.481
First… think of a person who helps you. See their face in your mind. … Now say thank you inside — just for them.

00:00:37.481 --> 00:00:49.371
Second… think of a place that feels good to be. A corner, a yard, a room. Be there for a moment. … Thank you, place.

00:00:49.371 --> 00:00:58.883
Third… think of one small good thing from today. A taste. A sound. A color you liked. Hold it gently. … Thank you.

00:00:58.883 --> 00:01:04.233
Three good things. They were here all along — we just stopped to notice them.

00:01:04.233 --> 00:01:09.584
Hands down. One more slow breath… and let it go.

00:01:09.584 --> 00:01:13.151
Eyes open. Look around your classroom.

00:01:13.151 --> 00:01:16.718
You're ready for what's next.
